{
  "_comment": [
    "A Godot game is played with what a desktop has: the keyboard, the mouse",
    "and a game controller. So the default is the identity: every key drives",
    "the key of the same name, the mouse drives the mouse (its place in the",
    "window, WMouse), and the first game controller drives player 1's. The",
    "wheel has no default: bind Mouse Wheel Up and Down to keys to turn it.",
    "The user's own bindings always win."
